@startuml
title isac-chat-mobile – application layers and ownership (2026-09-24)
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
legend right
  VERIFIED SOURCE = repository source evidence
  PARTIAL = source exists; runtime/deploy/acceptance gate remains
  PLANNED = target only, never current implementation
  External/partner scope is not owned by isac-chat-mobile
endlegend
package "Presentation / channel" as P {
  [REST / Angular / Android / adapter] as PRESENT
}
package "Application / domain" as A {
  [Kotlin / Gradle Android client application services] as APP
  [Kotlin / Gradle Android client domain rules] as DOMAIN
}
package "Persistence / integration" as I {
  [Repositories / outbox / contract adapters] as REPO
  [Owned database or external contract boundary] as DATA
}
package "Platform / operations" as O {
  [Keycloak / broker / object storage / deployment profile] as PLATFORM
}
PRESENT --> APP : authenticated request / event
APP --> DOMAIN : use case
DOMAIN --> REPO : owned state change
REPO --> DATA : persistence or typed delivery
APP --> PLATFORM : tenant, audit, telemetry
note right of DATA
  Downstream consumers:
  isac-chat\n  isac-api-spec
end note
@enduml
